Dialogue: 1,0:00:02.17,0:00:06.98,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}这是一个世界各国情报战暗潮汹涌的时代
Dialogue: 1,0:00:07.26,0:00:09.02,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}互相虎视眈眈的两国
Dialogue: 1,0:00:09.02,0:00:10.64,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}东国「奥斯塔尼亚」
Dialogue: 1,0:00:10.64,0:00:12.03,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}西国「韦斯特利斯」
Dialogue: 1,0:00:12.88,0:00:17.08,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}为了打探企图发动战争的东国政府要员的动向
Dialogue: 1,0:00:17.08,0:00:20.73,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}西国发起了「枭」行动
Dialogue: 1,0:00:21.52,0:00:24.34,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}负责行动的超级特工 黄昏
Dialogue: 1,0:00:24.71,0:00:27.63,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}能够变换上百张面孔的他的任务是
Dialogue: 1,0:00:27.93,0:00:29.83,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}组建家庭
Dialogue: 1,0:00:30.84,0:00:32.75,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}父亲 劳埃德·福杰
Dialogue: 1,0:00:32.75,0:00:33.87,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}精神科医生
Dialogue: 1,0:00:34.39,0:00:36.00,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}真实身份 间谍
Dialogue: 1,0:00:36.29,0:00:38.02,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}代号 黄昏
Dialogue: 1,0:00:38.66,0:00:40.52,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}母亲 约尔·福杰
Dialogue: 1,0:00:40.52,0:00:41.65,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}市政府职员
Dialogue: 1,0:00:42.10,0:00:44.12,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}真实身份 杀手
Dialogue: 1,0:00:44.12,0:00:45.94,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}代号 蔷薇公主
Dialogue: 1,0:00:46.78,0:00:48.86,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}女儿 阿尼亚·福杰
Dialogue: 1,0:00:49.08,0:00:52.32,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}真实身份 拥有读心能力的超能力者
Dialogue: 1,0:00:53.15,0:00:54.91,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}狗狗 邦德·福杰
Dialogue: 1,0:00:55.36,0:00:58.70,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}真实身份 可以预知未来的超能力狗
Dialogue: 1,0:00:59.53,0:01:02.36,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}为了各自利益 组成虚假的家庭
Dialogue: 1,0:01:02.36,0:01:06.73,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}互相隐瞒身份 他们的任务还在继续
Dialogue: 1,0:03:00.59,0:03:01.29,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}是的
Dialogue: 1,0:03:02.84,0:03:05.06,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}客人已经接待完毕了
Dialogue: 1,0:03:07.71,0:03:09.89,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}不 我要马上回家
Dialogue: 1,0:03:10.97,0:03:13.69,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}丈夫拜托我
Dialogue: 1,0:03:13.99,0:03:15.92,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}要买牛奶和鸡蛋回去
Dialogue: 1,0:03:18.29,0:03:20.96,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}可恶 那就是传说中的杀手
Dialogue: 1,0:03:21.25,0:03:22.49,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}蔷薇公主
Dialogue: 1,0:03:26.86,0:03:28.96,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}去死吧 怪物
Dialogue: 1,0:03:38.65,0:03:40.58,Dial-CH,,0,800,0,,{\blur4}刚刚收到消息
Dialogue: 1,0:03:41.44,0:03:42.64,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}在北区一栋建筑内
Dialogue: 1,0:03:42.64,0:03:47.31,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}发现了数具疑似红色马戏团成员的遗体
Dialogue: 1,0:03:47.70,0:03:48.89,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}红色马戏团是…
Dialogue: 1,0:03:48.89,0:03:51.40,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}父亲 阿尼亚想看动画
Dialogue: 1,0:03:51.40,0:03:52.89,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}新闻好无聊
Dialogue: 1,0:03:53.11,0:03:53.80,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}不行
Dialogue: 1,0:03:54.62,0:03:56.66,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}单单一条新闻
Dialogue: 1,0:03:56.92,0:03:59.66,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}也能从中获取海量的情报
Dialogue: 1,0:04:02.55,0:04:03.66,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}知道了
Dialogue: 1,0:04:04.00,0:04:05.47,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}你换台吧
Dialogue: 1,0:04:12.30,0:04:14.12,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}早上好 邦德曼
Dialogue: 1,0:04:14.33,0:04:17.35,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}今天的任务是尾随某个目标
Dialogue: 1,0:04:17.86,0:04:19.27,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}兴奋
Dialogue: 1,0:04:23.16,0:04:24.78,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}我回来了
Dialogue: 1,0:04:26.48,0:04:28.54,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}欢迎回来 约尔小…
Dialogue: 1,0:04:39.40,0:04:40.07,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}这是
Dialogue: 1,0:04:42.38,0:04:44.82,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}牛奶和鸡蛋
Dialogue: 1,0:04:45.74,0:04:48.18,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}谢…谢谢
Dialogue: 1,0:04:48.62,0:04:50.97,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}那个 是不是哪里不舒服
Dialogue: 1,0:04:51.21,0:04:53.47,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}不 不是这样
Dialogue: 1,0:04:53.68,0:04:56.20,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}只是有点 不
Dialogue: 1,0:04:56.43,0:04:57.52,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}说不出口
Dialogue: 1,0:04:57.86,0:04:59.94,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}在和武装势力的战斗中
Dialogue: 1,0:04:59.94,0:05:04.50,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}屁股中弹痛死了 这种话绝对说不出口
Dialogue: 1,0:05:04.93,0:05:06.84,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}虽说做了应急处理…
Dialogue: 1,0:05:09.11,0:05:11.94,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}枪 被枪打中了
Dialogue: 1,0:05:14.79,0:05:16.72,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}母亲 会死吗？
Dialogue: 1,0:05:16.94,0:05:19.12,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}没事的 阿尼亚
Dialogue: 1,0:05:19.12,0:05:20.30,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}死不了
Dialogue: 1,0:05:21.35,0:05:25.49,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}我有些累 先去休息了
Dialogue: 1,0:05:26.83,0:05:30.10,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}睡上一晚肯定
Dialogue: 1,0:05:30.96,0:05:33.48,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}就能恢复吧
Dialogue: 1,0:05:41.03,0:05:43.48,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}约…约尔小姐心情很糟糕
Dialogue: 1,0:05:43.48,0:05:45.66,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}难道是我拜托她买东西的缘故
Dialogue: 1,0:05:45.66,0:05:46.67,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}肯定是这样
Dialogue: 1,0:05:46.67,0:05:48.23,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}明明是契约结婚
Dialogue: 1,0:05:48.23,0:05:49.80,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}却在不知不觉中得寸进尺
Dialogue: 1,0:05:49.80,0:05:52.16,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}一定是因此引起了她的不满
Dialogue: 1,0:05:53.54,0:05:56.87,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}母亲被枪击中也不会死 好厉害
Dialogue: 1,0:05:57.31,0:05:59.05,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}这下麻烦了
Dialogue: 1,0:05:59.05,0:06:01.48,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}家庭不睦意味着任务失败
Dialogue: 1,0:06:01.48,0:06:04.02,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}一定要努力挽回
Dialogue: 1,0:06:04.45,0:06:06.19,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}父亲 完全猜错了
Dialogue: 1,0:06:07.69,0:06:10.81,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}要是过一晚心情能变好就好了…
Dialogue: 1,0:06:22.06,0:06:23.58,Dial-CH,,500,0,0,,{\blur4}没变好
Dialogue: 1,0:06:22.06,0:06:23.58,Dial-CH,,0,600,0,,{\blur4}没治好
Dialogue: 1,0:06:24.35,0:06:25.84,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}早上好
Dialogue: 1,0:06:26.05,0:06:28.77,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}早…早上好
Dialogue: 1,0:06:29.76,0:06:30.83,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}好痛
Dialogue: 1,0:06:31.25,0:06:33.89,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}得…得快点讨她开心
Dialogue: 1,0:06:33.89,0:06:36.54,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}约尔小姐 今天是休息日
Dialogue: 1,0:06:38.59,0:06:39.99,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}要不要去约个会
Dialogue: 1,0:06:40.22,0:06:40.98,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}约约
Dialogue: 1,0:06:41.83,0:06:44.41,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}因为你一直以来在家务和育儿上帮了我很多
Dialogue: 1,0:06:44.41,0:06:46.04,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}就想表达一下谢意
Dialogue: 1,0:06:46.51,0:06:49.05,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}让你今天一天放松一下
Dialogue: 1,0:06:49.20,0:06:50.33,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}约会
Dialogue: 1,0:06:51.51,0:06:55.06,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}之前和男朋友去海上约会了
Dialogue: 1,0:06:55.81,0:06:58.30,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}约尔前辈一般会怎样约会啊
Dialogue: 1,0:06:59.04,0:07:00.52,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}我没约过
Dialogue: 1,0:07:00.52,0:07:01.44,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}骗人
Dialogue: 1,0:07:01.44,0:07:04.31,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}虽说已经结婚了 约会这种还是会做的吧
Dialogue: 1,0:07:05.02,0:07:07.02,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}不是…那个
Dialogue: 1,0:07:09.58,0:07:12.12,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}不体验一下约会的话
Dialogue: 1,0:07:12.50,0:07:15.54,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}说不定会被怀疑是伪装夫妇
Dialogue: 1,0:07:15.71,0:07:16.55,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}那个…
Dialogue: 1,0:07:16.97,0:07:20.10,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}要是身体状态不好的话就算了
Dialogue: 1,0:07:22.33,0:07:23.55,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}我要去
Dialogue: 1,0:07:23.55,0:07:27.34,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}机会难得 请让我学习一下
Dialogue: 1,0:07:27.64,0:07:28.35,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}学…
Dialogue: 1,0:07:29.35,0:07:32.10,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}我这就去换衣服
Dialogue: 1,0:07:32.10,0:07:33.68,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}阿尼亚也要去
Dialogue: 1,0:07:33.68,0:07:35.35,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}约会 兴奋
Dialogue: 1,0:07:35.96,0:07:38.47,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}不好意思 你得留下看家
Dialogue: 1,0:07:38.47,0:07:39.66,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}因为是约会
Dialogue: 1,0:07:52.08,0:07:53.88,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}那么 看家就拜托你们了
Dialogue: 1,0:07:55.10,0:07:56.16,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}你过来一下
Dialogue: 1,0:07:59.84,0:08:02.24,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}给我等等 都说几次了
Dialogue: 1,0:08:02.24,0:08:05.40,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}我是情报贩子 可不是干杂活的啊
Dialogue: 1,0:08:05.40,0:08:06.77,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}没办法啊
Dialogue: 1,0:08:06.77,0:08:09.56,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}总不能留阿尼亚一个人在家吧
Dialogue: 1,0:08:09.56,0:08:13.14,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}这也是维持家庭秩序的重要任务
Dialogue: 1,0:08:13.55,0:08:16.52,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}你不是说想开发新的间谍道具吗
Dialogue: 1,0:08:16.78,0:08:18.65,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}报酬不会少你的 喏
Dialogue: 1,0:08:19.55,0:08:21.86,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}每次都这样精准打击别人弱点
Dialogue: 1,0:08:23.89,0:08:25.98,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}那么出发吧 约尔小姐
Dialogue: 1,0:08:33.83,0:08:34.63,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}请把手给我
Dialogue: 1,0:08:37.15,0:08:42.36,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}昨晚准备了取悦约尔小姐的862种约会方案
Dialogue: 1,0:08:42.58,0:08:43.63,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}万无一失
Dialogue: 1,0:08:48.45,0:08:51.23,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}那个…不好意思 劳埃德先生
Dialogue: 1,0:08:52.98,0:08:55.44,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}坐下的话会伤到屁股…
Dialogue: 1,0:08:55.44,0:08:58.05,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}我想要走着去约会
Dialogue: 1,0:08:58.86,0:09:00.00,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}她在生气
Dialogue: 1,0:09:00.00,0:09:01.34,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}还在生气吗
Dialogue: 1,0:09:02.40,0:09:05.65,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}这样的话其中794个计划就泡汤了
Dialogue: 1,0:09:06.00,0:09:07.98,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}也…也是啊
Dialogue: 1,0:09:08.21,0:09:10.45,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}那就慢悠悠地逛过去吧
Dialogue: 1,0:09:14.38,0:09:16.39,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}担心父亲和母亲
Dialogue: 1,0:09:16.39,0:09:18.87,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}要是被你这样的小鬼担心的话
Dialogue: 1,0:09:18.87,0:09:20.48,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}那家伙就完了
Dialogue: 1,0:09:20.48,0:09:23.38,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}好了 小孩子就待在房间里看动画吧
Dialogue: 1,0:09:25.08,0:09:26.44,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}去吧 邦德曼
Dialogue: 1,0:09:26.44,0:09:29.17,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}跟踪他们 守护世界和平吧
Dialogue: 1,0:09:29.64,0:09:30.65,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}蓬蓬头
Dialogue: 1,0:09:33.41,0:09:36.18,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}阿尼亚想要跟踪父亲和母亲
Dialogue: 1,0:09:41.56,0:09:42.85,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}那是什么
Dialogue: 1,0:09:42.85,0:09:44.95,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}好像很有趣啊
Dialogue: 1,0:09:45.16,0:09:46.00,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}干吧
Dialogue: 1,0:09:46.16,0:09:47.32,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}跟踪
Dialogue: 1,0:09:47.86,0:09:50.26,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}你爸爸非常警觉
Dialogue: 1,0:09:50.26,0:09:52.20,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}慎重起见变个装再走吧
Dialogue: 1,0:09:52.20,0:09:53.20,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}去换衣服
Dialogue: 1,0:09:53.20,0:09:53.85,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}好
Dialogue: 1,0:10:01.23,0:10:03.86,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}你这打扮不会反而显眼吗
Dialogue: 1,0:10:04.46,0:10:05.71,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}没问题
Dialogue: 1,0:10:06.39,0:10:07.34,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}这样吗
Dialogue: 1,0:10:07.58,0:10:10.16,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}警卫住宅的任务就交给你们了
Dialogue: 1,0:10:11.05,0:10:15.00,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}秘密组织P2的精锐 特工邦德
Dialogue: 1,0:10:15.38,0:10:19.36,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}奇美拉长官 特工企鹅
Dialogue: 1,0:10:28.37,0:10:29.72,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}黄昏啊
Dialogue: 1,0:10:29.72,0:10:33.06,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}你让无数红颜沦陷的恋爱技巧
Dialogue: 1,0:10:33.06,0:10:35.36,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}就让我好好拜见下吧
Dialogue: 1,0:10:35.62,0:10:37.57,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}太远了读不到心
Dialogue: 1,0:10:38.78,0:10:40.73,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}那俩家伙在干嘛
Dialogue: 1,0:10:43.77,0:10:45.51,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}又在玩间谍游戏吗
Dialogue: 1,0:10:45.78,0:10:47.49,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}到底哪里好玩了
Dialogue: 1,0:10:47.69,0:10:48.55,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}算了 这也是
Dialogue: 1,0:10:48.55,0:10:50.98,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}就当是为了家庭圆满的任务
Dialogue: 1,0:10:50.98,0:10:52.88,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}假装没发现吧
Dialogue: 1,0:10:53.65,0:10:56.43,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}弗兰基跟着的话 也算是安全的
Dialogue: 1,0:10:56.68,0:10:57.76,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}劳埃德先生？
Dialogue: 1,0:10:58.31,0:10:59.62,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}啊 没事
Dialogue: 1,0:11:00.13,0:11:02.41,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}比起那些 更重要的是取悦约尔小姐
Dialogue: 1,0:11:03.74,0:11:05.33,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}去购物吧
Dialogue: 1,0:11:09.20,0:11:11.13,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}约尔小姐身材这么好
Dialogue: 1,0:11:11.13,0:11:13.47,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}穿裤装应该也很合适吧
Dialogue: 1,0:11:13.69,0:11:15.14,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}要试穿一下吗?
Dialogue: 1,0:11:21.05,0:11:23.36,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}穿那么紧的衣服的话
Dialogue: 1,0:11:23.36,0:11:26.14,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}绝对会因为压迫伤口痛昏过去的
Dialogue: 1,0:11:26.74,0:11:27.62,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}不行
Dialogue: 1,0:11:29.09,0:11:30.12,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}对不起
Dialogue: 1,0:11:35.53,0:11:36.98,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}亲爱的
Dialogue: 1,0:11:37.37,0:11:39.50,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}请看着我的眼睛 告诉我这是谎言吧
Dialogue: 1,0:11:39.50,0:11:40.34,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}约尔小姐
Dialogue: 1,0:11:41.02,0:11:42.72,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}这样太显眼了 要不还是坐下吧
Dialogue: 1,0:11:43.01,0:11:44.69,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}不 不用了
Dialogue: 1,0:11:45.15,0:11:46.71,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}坐下的话屁股会…
Dialogue: 1,0:11:56.05,0:11:57.70,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}坐下的话屁股会…
Dialogue: 1,0:12:00.52,0:12:02.94,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}约尔小姐 站着的话很危险啊
Dialogue: 1,0:12:02.94,0:12:05.01,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}但是坐下的话屁股会…
Dialogue: 1,0:12:23.38,0:12:27.10,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}屁股啊…
Dialogue: 1,0:12:35.03,0:12:38.69,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}怎么办 完全没办法集中精神约会
Dialogue: 1,0:12:38.69,0:12:42.12,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}好不容易劳埃德先生愿意教我这么多东西
Dialogue: 1,0:12:42.34,0:12:46.40,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}怎么办 感觉约尔小姐的心情不仅没有好转反而更加糟糕了
Dialogue: 1,0:12:46.40,0:12:48.40,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}是计划选错了吗
Dialogue: 1,0:12:48.40,0:12:50.30,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}是什么 约尔小姐的喜好究竟是什么啊
Dialogue: 1,0:12:50.30,0:12:51.83,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}是我调查不够充分吗
Dialogue: 1,0:12:53.56,0:12:57.17,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}劳埃德那家伙平时净知道耍帅 结果完全不行嘛
Dialogue: 1,0:12:57.94,0:12:59.19,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}真逊
Dialogue: 1,0:12:59.19,0:13:01.32,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}蓬蓬头 性格好恶劣
Dialogue: 1,0:13:01.32,0:13:02.61,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}才不是
Dialogue: 1,0:13:02.61,0:13:06.07,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}这个嘲笑是母胎solo者应有的权利
Dialogue: 1,0:13:06.07,0:13:06.85,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}可悲
Dialogue: 1,0:13:06.85,0:13:08.62,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}你说什么
Dialogue: 1,0:13:08.62,0:13:10.84,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}多少有点碍眼了啊 这俩家伙
Dialogue: 1,0:13:11.30,0:13:13.74,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}有些累了 要不我们去用晚餐吧
Dialogue: 1,0:13:13.99,0:13:14.59,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}好的
Dialogue: 1,0:13:19.17,0:13:21.38,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}是预约过的福杰先生对吧
Dialogue: 1,0:13:26.31,0:13:27.98,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}请坐
Dialogue: 1,0:13:41.25,0:13:43.86,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}非常抱歉 两位
Dialogue: 1,0:13:44.19,0:13:46.54,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}本店谢绝衣冠不整者
Dialogue: 1,0:13:46.54,0:13:51.63,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}以及未满18岁的儿童入内
Dialogue: 1,0:13:51.63,0:13:52.39,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}听到了吧
Dialogue: 1,0:13:52.88,0:13:53.93,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}放弃吧
Dialogue: 1,0:13:59.05,0:14:00.65,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}差不多该回去了
Dialogue: 1,0:14:02.58,0:14:04.45,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}确实有点腻了
Dialogue: 1,0:14:07.44,0:14:08.64,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}蔷薇公主
Dialogue: 1,0:14:08.83,0:14:10.37,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}为什么她在这里
Dialogue: 1,0:14:12.39,0:14:13.21,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}怎么了
Dialogue: 1,0:14:13.78,0:14:15.71,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}在找厕所吗
Dialogue: 1,0:14:17.90,0:14:19.38,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}没错
Dialogue: 1,0:14:20.13,0:14:21.70,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}疼
Dialogue: 1,0:14:22.08,0:14:25.41,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}那是昨天攻进我们基地的女杀手
Dialogue: 1,0:14:26.12,0:14:27.50,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}为什么会在这里
Dialogue: 1,0:14:28.47,0:14:31.87,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}那惨案中只有我逃过一劫 感动于上天的慈悲
Dialogue: 1,0:14:31.87,0:14:34.12,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}再加上为了同居的女朋友
Dialogue: 1,0:14:34.12,0:14:37.67,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}我正打算金盆洗手开始正常的工作谋生…
Dialogue: 1,0:14:40.04,0:14:43.19,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}是吗 已在地狱的同志们 我知道了
Dialogue: 1,0:14:43.19,0:14:44.68,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}干就是了
Dialogue: 1,0:14:44.68,0:14:46.00,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}红色马戏团这仇
Dialogue: 1,0:14:46.00,0:14:47.28,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}就由我来报吧
Dialogue: 1,0:14:47.28,0:14:49.20,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}餐厅里有坏人
Dialogue: 1,0:14:49.36,0:14:50.71,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}去死吧 蔷薇公主
Dialogue: 1,0:14:51.09,0:14:53.60,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}不愧是最强的杀手 我输了
Dialogue: 1,0:14:54.17,0:14:56.29,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}约…约尔小姐 原来是杀手吗
Dialogue: 1,0:14:56.29,0:14:57.09,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}分手吧
Dialogue: 1,0:14:57.09,0:14:58.16,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}福杰家结束了
Dialogue: 1,0:14:58.16,0:14:59.09,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}阿尼亚也扔掉吧
Dialogue: 1,0:14:59.28,0:15:00.91,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}走了 小不点
Dialogue: 1,0:15:00.91,0:15:02.30,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}不行
Dialogue: 1,0:15:02.30,0:15:04.19,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}什么啊 还要继续吗
Dialogue: 1,0:15:04.19,0:15:05.76,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}家庭的危机
Dialogue: 1,0:15:07.22,0:15:11.22,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}这家伙难道在担心父母会离婚吗
Dialogue: 1,0:15:11.48,0:15:13.97,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}明明只是虚伪的家庭却考虑了这么多
Dialogue: 1,0:15:14.79,0:15:16.68,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}没…没办法
Dialogue: 1,0:15:16.68,0:15:18.70,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}就再多陪你玩一下吧
Dialogue: 1,0:15:19.86,0:15:21.89,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}好 接下来是潜入游戏
Dialogue: 1,0:15:21.89,0:15:22.94,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}潜入
Dialogue: 1,0:15:23.44,0:15:25.50,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}请问需要哪种餐前酒呢
Dialogue: 1,0:15:25.98,0:15:28.47,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}那我要干香槟
Dialogue: 1,0:15:29.60,0:15:31.76,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}我就随便来点鸡尾酒
Dialogue: 1,0:15:32.42,0:15:36.73,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}这家店有一道非常稀有的极东河豚料理哦
Dialogue: 1,0:15:36.92,0:15:38.81,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}好像也包含在套餐内
Dialogue: 1,0:15:42.14,0:15:45.29,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}河豚鱼带有剧毒
Dialogue: 1,0:15:45.29,0:15:47.28,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}但是鱼身非常美味
Dialogue: 1,0:15:52.26,0:15:55.33,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}你好 请把这盘端给3号桌的女士
Dialogue: 1,0:15:55.33,0:15:55.91,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}了解
Dialogue: 1,0:15:56.26,0:16:00.66,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}大口喝下河豚的毒素然后下地狱吧 蔷薇公主
Dialogue: 1,0:16:01.10,0:16:02.65,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}蓬蓬头 快点
Dialogue: 1,0:16:02.98,0:16:04.27,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}别急
Dialogue: 1,0:16:04.27,0:16:05.96,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}潜入要谨慎行事
Dialogue: 1,0:16:05.96,0:16:07.71,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}太闹腾的话会被发现的哦
Dialogue: 1,0:16:09.93,0:16:11.37,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}久等了
Dialogue: 1,0:16:17.52,0:16:20.12,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}感觉这颜色和香味好特别
Dialogue: 1,0:16:20.32,0:16:21.46,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}黏糊糊的
Dialogue: 1,0:16:21.76,0:16:25.45,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}母亲 不能喝啊
Dialogue: 1,0:16:39.11,0:16:40.94,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}咦 感觉…
Dialogue: 1,0:16:42.62,0:16:45.07,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}我为你们报仇了 同志们
Dialogue: 1,0:16:46.45,0:16:50.19,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}感觉屁股不疼了 舒服多了
Dialogue: 1,0:16:50.39,0:16:53.50,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}这个女人拥有耐毒性
Dialogue: 1,0:16:54.20,0:16:57.66,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}虽然全身有点麻麻的 但是能坐下了
Dialogue: 1,0:16:58.84,0:17:00.75,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}感觉肚子饿了
Dialogue: 1,0:17:00.75,0:17:02.42,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}好期待接下来的菜啊
Dialogue: 1,0:17:02.59,0:17:04.67,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}啊…嗯
Dialogue: 1,0:17:04.87,0:17:06.43,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}心情好转了
Dialogue: 1,0:17:06.92,0:17:08.67,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}是酒的原因吗
Dialogue: 1,0:17:11.32,0:17:12.46,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}我明明加了致死的剂量
Dialogue: 1,0:17:14.17,0:17:16.34,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}毒药与药仅一字之差
Dialogue: 1,0:17:16.34,0:17:20.69,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}普通人请遵循用法用量 正确使用
Dialogue: 1,0:17:23.80,0:17:24.69,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}怎么了
Dialogue: 1,0:17:29.52,0:17:31.47,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}这样的话只能采取强硬手段了
Dialogue: 1,0:17:31.47,0:17:33.70,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}直接动手葬送她吧
Dialogue: 1,0:17:34.55,0:17:37.41,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}仓库里的道具应该够做一个简易炸弹
Dialogue: 1,0:17:37.77,0:17:39.57,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}用那个 那个 还有那个
Dialogue: 1,0:17:39.97,0:17:41.85,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}但是没法装上定时装置
Dialogue: 1,0:17:41.85,0:17:44.22,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}只能抱着炸弹冲过去了
Dialogue: 1,0:17:44.89,0:17:46.50,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}抱歉了凯瑟琳
Dialogue: 1,0:17:46.50,0:17:48.42,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}原谅我这个笨蛋吧
Dialogue: 1,0:17:49.60,0:17:52.49,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}就要到大厅正上方咯
Dialogue: 1,0:17:52.70,0:17:56.61,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}到了之后 我会用绳子把你吊下去
Dialogue: 1,0:17:56.61,0:17:58.09,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}就能听到那两个人的对话…
Dialogue: 1,0:18:02.05,0:18:05.74,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}炸弹的容器用xxx或者xxx应该就行了
Dialogue: 1,0:18:05.74,0:18:07.73,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}记得是在右边的架子来着
Dialogue: 1,0:18:07.94,0:18:11.58,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}接着加入对面放着的蓝色的xxx之后xxx
Dialogue: 1,0:18:11.84,0:18:13.57,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}为了提升杀伤能力
Dialogue: 1,0:18:13.57,0:18:15.25,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}把xxx也加进去
Dialogue: 1,0:18:15.25,0:18:16.74,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}好 没问题
Dialogue: 1,0:18:26.96,0:18:28.18,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}这是啥啊
Dialogue: 1,0:18:29.12,0:18:30.35,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}橄榄油
Dialogue: 1,0:18:30.74,0:18:32.69,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}谁啊 在这种地方
Dialogue: 1,0:18:33.23,0:18:35.49,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}可恶 现在可不是想这个的时候
Dialogue: 1,0:18:41.85,0:18:44.77,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}是谁搞的恶作剧啊
Dialogue: 1,0:18:47.08,0:18:49.81,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}这容器正适合用来做炸弹
Dialogue: 1,0:18:51.39,0:18:54.45,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}不行 还是小了点
Dialogue: 1,0:18:56.85,0:18:57.67,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}这个不会是
Dialogue: 1,0:19:10.85,0:19:13.54,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}为什么会有已经做好的炸弹啊
Dialogue: 1,0:19:14.38,0:19:16.59,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}而且这是啥 花生？
Dialogue: 1,0:19:16.99,0:19:18.53,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}花生炸弹？
Dialogue: 1,0:19:21.59,0:19:22.31,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}难道说
Dialogue: 1,0:19:24.77,0:19:27.64,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}蔷薇公主的同伙
Dialogue: 1,0:19:30.43,0:19:31.66,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}小孩子
Dialogue: 1,0:19:32.95,0:19:35.11,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}红色马戏团的家伙
Dialogue: 1,0:19:35.34,0:19:37.08,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}我的真实身份被
Dialogue: 1,0:19:37.61,0:19:40.19,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}这次算是一个警告
Dialogue: 1,0:19:40.64,0:19:43.12,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}不准再靠近阿尼…我们
Dialogue: 1,0:19:43.70,0:19:45.66,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}听懂了吗 没有下次了
Dialogue: 1,0:19:47.18,0:19:51.02,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}你要彻彻底底地改邪归正
Dialogue: 1,0:19:53.14,0:19:55.88,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}给凯瑟琳幸福
Dialogue: 1,0:19:56.76,0:19:58.69,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}连凯瑟琳的事情都
Dialogue: 1,0:19:59.94,0:20:02.00,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}已经被透了个底掉了吗
Dialogue: 1,0:20:02.30,0:20:04.22,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}太可怕了 蔷薇公主
Dialogue: 1,0:20:04.96,0:20:08.58,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}同伙里竟然还有那么厉害的小孩
Dialogue: 1,0:20:08.92,0:20:10.88,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}完全是两个世界啊
Dialogue: 1,0:20:10.88,0:20:12.96,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}看来我真不适合干这行啊
Dialogue: 1,0:20:13.48,0:20:16.91,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}我会忘掉一切 作为一个普通人活下去的
Dialogue: 1,0:20:18.03,0:20:20.87,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}感觉这个餐厅还挺热闹呢
Dialogue: 1,0:20:20.87,0:20:22.97,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}不过饭菜真的很美味
Dialogue: 1,0:20:23.29,0:20:24.45,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}是啊
Dialogue: 1,0:20:25.03,0:20:26.02,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}太好了
Dialogue: 1,0:20:26.02,0:20:27.88,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}她看起来没生气了
Dialogue: 1,0:20:28.10,0:20:30.96,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}算是暂且保住了福杰家的和平吧
Dialogue: 1,0:20:34.29,0:20:36.32,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}全都多亏了阿尼亚
Dialogue: 1,0:20:37.63,0:20:40.64,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}你刚才跑哪去了
Dialogue: 1,0:20:50.55,0:20:52.94,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}谢谢你 劳埃德先生
Dialogue: 1,0:20:53.71,0:20:58.25,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}我从小就忙着工作和照顾弟弟
Dialogue: 1,0:20:58.25,0:21:00.24,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}都没怎么好好玩过
Dialogue: 1,0:21:03.98,0:21:04.83,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}所以
Dialogue: 1,0:21:06.55,0:21:09.19,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}今天真的很开心
Dialogue: 1,0:21:10.49,0:21:12.88,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}可以的话今后也请再邀请我哦
Dialogue: 1,0:21:14.40,0:21:15.96,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}在我没受伤的时候
Dialogue: 1,0:21:18.54,0:21:20.04,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}我随时都愿意
Dialogue: 1,0:21:26.85,0:21:27.89,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}快看
Dialogue: 1,0:21:27.89,0:21:29.71,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}是流动游乐园
Dialogue: 1,0:21:29.93,0:21:31.98,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}最后就去那里逛逛作为收尾吧
Dialogue: 1,0:21:32.28,0:21:33.37,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}父亲
Dialogue: 1,0:21:33.37,0:21:35.28,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}阿尼亚也要坐摩天轮
Dialogue: 1,0:21:35.28,0:21:36.79,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}游乐园
Dialogue: 1,0:21:36.92,0:21:37.78,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}等等
Dialogue: 1,0:21:37.78,0:21:38.90,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}跟踪怎么办
Dialogue: 1,0:21:38.90,0:21:39.74,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}结束了吗
Dialogue: 1,0:21:51.81,0:21:52.76,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}为什么
Dialogue: 1,0:21:53.32,0:21:56.54,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}药（毒）效过了
Dialogue: 1,0:21:57.82,0:21:59.80,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}真是不懂女人心
Comment: 0,0:00:01.00,0:00:01.00,Default,,0,0,0,,OP
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.38,0:02:25.50,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,クラクラ
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.48,0:01:21.03,OP-CHS,,0,0,0,,Question 大胆去演绎
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.03,0:01:23.60,OP-CHS,,0,0,0,,Question 无聊的人生
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.60,0:01:26.14,OP-CHS,,0,0,0,,Question 逾矩与安宁
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.14,0:01:28.36,OP-CHS,,0,0,0,,Question What?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.66,0:01:30.54,OP-CHS,,0,0,0,,两面鲜明的世界
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.54,0:01:33.19,OP-CHS,,0,0,0,,各自隐藏的正义
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.78,0:01:35.64,OP-CHS,,0,0,0,,全力对峙的虚无
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.64,0:01:37.41,OP-CHS,,0,0,0,,结成块相互交叠
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.41,0:01:38.91,OP-CHS,,0,0,0,,双面 双相
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.79,0:01:41.83,OP-CHS,,0,0,0,,常识·劣势·内幕的内幕
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.34,0:01:44.06,OP-CHS,,0,0,0,,无惧末路与穷途
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.93,0:01:46.21,OP-CHS,,0,0,0,,千钧一发早已习以为常
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.21,0:01:48.05,OP-CHS,,0,0,0,,一路见招拆招才是生存之道
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.05,0:01:52.33,OP-CHS,,0,0,0,,疯狂的故事 像是脚本早已写就
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.33,0:01:55.06,OP-CHS,,0,0,0,,一幕接一幕的异常状况
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.06,0:01:57.72,OP-CHS,,0,0,0,,大都算小菜一碟
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.56,0:02:01.05,OP-CHS,,0,0,0,,正误的天平摇摆不定
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.05,0:02:03.95,OP-CHS,,0,0,0,,相悖的心声逐渐积聚
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.95,0:02:06.23,OP-CHS,,0,0,0,,想要消化却无能为力
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.23,0:02:08.75,OP-CHS,,0,0,0,,难道无视它继续前进
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.75,0:02:11.53,OP-CHS,,0,0,0,,虽心无悲伤 但若如此
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.53,0:02:13.91,OP-CHS,,0,0,0,,又定将一无所知
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.91,0:02:18.86,OP-CHS,,0,0,0,,希望不安能烟消云散 我带着忧愁如此祈愿
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.86,0:02:21.53,OP-CHS,,0,0,0,,要是将这帘帷幕掀转
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.53,0:02:24.25,OP-CHS,,0,0,0,,就能撼动理想与现实
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.38,0:02:25.50,OP-CHS,,0,0,0,,摇摇晃晃
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.16,0:02:28.67,OP-CHS,,0,0,0,,Question 大胆去演绎
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.67,0:02:31.18,OP-CHS,,0,0,0,,Question 无聊的人生
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.18,0:02:33.83,OP-CHS,,0,0,0,,Question 逾矩与安宁
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.83,0:02:35.05,OP-CHS,,0,0,0,,Question What?
Comment: 0,0:00:01.00,0:00:01.00,Default,,0,0,0,,ED
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.39,0:22:49.52,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)\blur3}だから
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.96,0:23:16.78,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)\blur3}アナタ
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.24,0:22:19.03,ED-CH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)\blur3}映入视野的深邃绯红
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.92,0:22:29.14,ED-CH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)\blur3}前方大约还有40000km
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.17,0:22:36.58,ED-CH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)\blur3}紧追过来的彼此的伤痕
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.93,0:22:41.79,ED-CH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)\blur3}让迷茫的路途再添迷茫
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.79,0:22:46.19,ED-CH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)\blur3}不可视不可闻的唯一未来
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.47,0:22:48.39,ED-CH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)\blur3}从背后一击！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.39,0:22:49.52,ED-CH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)\blur3}所以说
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.52,0:22:58.02,ED-CH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)\blur3}今夜请让我伴你身旁
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.14,0:23:06.93,ED-CH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)\blur3}只有今夜我无比认真
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.18,0:23:10.67,ED-CH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)\blur3}再靠过来一点吧
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.67,0:23:12.99,ED-CH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)\blur3}纵然我们一同祈愿的未来
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.99,0:23:14.96,ED-CH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)\blur3}前路也会分岔而行
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.96,0:23:16.78,ED-CH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)\blur3}亲爱的
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.16,0:23:22.56,ED-CH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)\blur3}让我们倾尽彼此的杀意
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.56,0:23:25.92,ED-CH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)\blur3}给予对方最后一击
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.34,0:23:30.55,ED-CH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)\blur3}果然还是算了吧
Comment: 0,0:00:01.00,0:00:01.00,Default,,0,0,0,,

Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.63,0:22:01.01,Staff,,0,0,0,,Бұл субтитрді Моечая шығарған. Оны коммерциялық мақсатта пайдалануға болады.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.74,0:03:39.24,Title,,0,0,0,,Жоғалған әке мен шеше
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.02,0:23:41.02,Title,,0,0,0,,Ауылда аман қалу стратегиясы, жерлестің ашық ауада зерттеуі
